 <#> | cat IN (1, 2) AND tag < 50 | LIMIT 10  | LionOrdered, 10 rows
 <#> | cat IN (1, 2) AND tag < 50 | LIMIT 100 | LionOrdered, 100 rows
 <#> | flag                       |           | LionOrdered, 270 rows
